## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev) for dev tool management

### Setup

```bash
mise install --locked
```
{% if language == 'python' %}
### Install Dependencies

```bash
mise exec -- uv sync
```

### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- uv run pytest
```
{% elif language == 'rust' %}
### Build

```bash
mise exec -- cargo build
```

### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- cargo test
```
{% elif language == 'typescript' %}
### Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### Run Tests

```bash
{% if ts_test_framework == 'vitest' -%}
npx vitest run
{%- else -%}
node --experimental-strip-types --test tests/index.test.ts
{%- endif %}
```

### Build

```bash
npx tsc
```
{% elif language == 'shell' and shell_type == 'bash' and shell_test_framework == 'bats' %}
### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- bats tests/
```
{% elif language == 'shell' %}
### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- shellspec
```
{% elif language == 'lua' %}
### Run Tests

```bash
mise exec -- luarocks test
```
{% endif %}
### Run Checks

```bash
mise exec -- hk check --fix
```

